[[SECTION]]
TITLE: CPU Idling

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEP-SRS-41-1
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
COMPONENT: CPU Idling
TITLE: Idling the current CPU
STATEMENT: >>>
The Zephyr RTOS shall provide an interface to place the current
CPU into a low-power idle state until an event wakes it.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ZEP-SYRS-42

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ZEP-SRS-41-2
STATUS: Draft
TYPE: Functional
COMPONENT: CPU Idling
TITLE: Atomically enabling interrupts and idling
STATEMENT: >>>
The Zephyr RTOS shall provide an interface to place the current CPU into a
low-power idle state, atomically re-enabling interrupts as the CPU enters the idle
state.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: ZEP-SYRS-42

[[/SECTION]]
